# truss-agent-mcp core rules

Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for full operations.

## Security
- Never commit secrets; `.env` is gitignored.
- `TRUSS_API_KEY` in host env only — never in MCP tool args or error output.
- No internal Truss endpoints, private repo names, or unreleased API docs.

## API scope
- Public tier only: `/product/search`, `/product/search/stix`, `/product/{id}/stix`.
- Do not add admin-route tools without explicit API + SDK support.

## Code changes
- Minimize diff; match existing TypeScript ESM style.
- Tool changes: update `schemas.ts`, `register-tools.ts`, `instructions.ts`, and `docs/04-mcp-tool-catalog.md`.
- Default IOC-safe summaries; `include_indicators` is opt-in.
- Run `npm run build && npm test` after substantive changes.
